# Normalize to LF in the working tree regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Rationale: docs/findings/F2-upstream-drift.md - autocrlf=true on this machine
# rewrote checked-out files and git stat-cache then falsely reported them clean.
# CRLF drift would also break F3 firmware build determinism.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.stl  binary
*.step binary
*.f3z  binary
*.zip  binary
*.elf  binary
*.bin  binary
